 "level_notes": {
  "1": "No specification: each library documents its own parsing rules (Docker Compose's env-file syntax and the dotenvx/dotenvy format pages are the most explicit). The Twelve-Factor App 'Config' chapter is the design rationale.",
  "0": "The parsers are the de-facto definitions: bkeepers/dotenv (Ruby, original), motdotla/dotenv (Node), python-dotenv, godotenv.",
  "3": "No Wikipedia or PLDB page."
 },
